<header>
  <div class="section">layout</div>
  <h2>title at the top, the rest for content</h2>
  <p class="sub">wrap the title (and a .section kicker, a p.sub subtitle) in a &lt;header&gt;</p>
</header>
<div class="cols small">
  <div>
    <h3>header</h3>
    <p>pinned to the top; whatever follows is centered in the space below it</p>
    <p class="muted">add <code>class="fill"</code> to the content to give it all of that space instead</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>size</h3>
    <p>every slide is laid out on a 1600×900 canvas, scaled to the window</p>
    <p class="muted">bigger screen → everything bigger, small window → smaller but never cut off. size things in px or em; for % of the slide use <code>cqw</code> / <code>cqh</code>, not <code>vw</code> / <code>vh</code></p>
  </div>
</div>
